2h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></nav></header><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-ink pt-24 text-white\" data-scroll-theme=\"dark\" data-surface=\"dark\"><div class=\"grain-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-[1400px] grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:px-14 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><span class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-light\">Pricing</span><h1 class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">Simple plans.<!-- --> <span class=\"text-gold-light italic\">Earned</span> trust at every tier.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75\">Flat pricing with verified reviews, native email and SMS, and multi-domain included — no pay-to-protect schemes or annual lock-in.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-ink shadow-xl gold-foil\" href=\"/signup\">Start free trial<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/audit\">Run a free audit first</a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.96)\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-2xl\"><img alt=\"EarnedStar pricing dashboard — verified review metrics and flat plan cards\" width=\"1024\" height=