\"card-surface overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-4 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-gold\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Can I import reviews I already have?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-text-muted transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"card-surface overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-4 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-gold\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Why can&#x27;t I add extra reviews manually later?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-text-muted transition\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"card-surface overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-4 text-left focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-gold\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Is every review actually verified to a real purchase?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-text-muted tra